  "body": "This attempts to make this algorithm as similar to “initialising a new\nDocument object” as possible to make it easier to merge parts of them\ngoing forward:\n- It adds the text “Do not obtain any source texts for scripts or\n  modules.” for the InitializeHostDefinedRealm() which appeared to be\n  missing.\n- It more explicitly allocates a new browsing context and returns it.\n- It changes the order of some steps to match those of the other\n  algorithm.\n- It removes an unused variable allocation in the other algorithm.\n",
